{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606610/extras/titleLogo.png?t=1696842032\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;Supply energy to many spaceships in this small, chill resource and time management game.<br><br>A Cooked-Like, if you will!&quot;</h2><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606610/extras/inDescScreenshot.png?t=1696842032\" /><br><br>Handle machinery and energizing items as <strong>Bobby</strong>, a spaceship engineer, in this short game, inspired by Overcooked!<br>After a long development time, this game proudly sports polished <i>pixel animations</i> and <i>orchestra-chiptune hybrids</i>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Controls (Keyboard/gamepad)</u>:</h2>WASD/Arrows/Stick/D-pad to move.<br>Space/Enter/E/Action Buttons to interact with objects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Credits:</u></h2>Art: Blawnode, KingKelpo.<br><br>Code: redsti, Blawnode, Nazsgull (Prototyping).<br>Music: NoStereo.<br>SFX: sound_digitator.<br><br>Made with Unity 2020.3.17f1 and FMod 2.01.11.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Links and socials (also seen in-game, in the main menu's credits!)</u></h2><br>Blawnode<br>    Twitter: @blawnode <br><br>Ajoeb &quot;KingKelpo&quot; Gaasim<br>    Twitter: @kelpoking<br><br>Nazsgull<br>    Twitter: @pabloarev<br><br>redsti<br>    Twitter: @redsti<br><br>NoStereo<br>    Twitter: @NoStereoMusic<br><br>Gene &quot;sound_digitator&quot; Chaban<br>    Twitter: @genechab_audio","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Charged Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2606610/b769fd63d61ca63e3b758c47eb16572144117588.jpg"},{"name":"Knowledgeable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2606610/e656e69121d53e4ccf55ccec1c390f2e22e653f2.jpg"},{"name":"Taking Off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2606610/235d0d448750ffdd74